# One Vercel deployment, three hosts. On summarevent.vercel.app (the main link) and summarevent-live.vercel.app the app
# talks to the shared backend through the same-origin /api, which vercel.json proxies to Convex. Any other host, such as
# the backup summarevent-cadangan.vercel.app, keeps every record in the browser (the in-browser version).
VITE_LIVE_HOSTS=summarevent.vercel.app,summarevent-live.vercel.app
VITE_LIVE_URL=https://summarevent-live.vercel.app
